      "extractedText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nPROVIN\nwebsite : www.miaqao.qov.ph\nemail address: Iqumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR THE CONCRETING OF LOCAL ACCESS ROAD,\nMUNICIPALITY OE MIAGAO\n1. The Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Trust Fund (DILG-AM), Budget Year 2018 intends to apply the sum of P\n8,900,577.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under the\ncontract for the Concreting of Local Access Road, Municipality of Miagao. Bids received in\nexcess of the ABC shall be automatically rejected at bid opening\n2.The Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the Concreting of Local Access Road,\nMunicipality of Miagao\nITEM NO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\n1\n1\nJOB\nCONTRACT ON LOCAL ACCESS ROAD IN BRGY.\nPALACA PROPER - SITIO GINES ROAD\n1. Clearing and grubbing of site / mobilization of equipment\nQty. : 1,500 sq.m.\n2. Earthworks\nQuantity: 1.500 sq.m.\nVolume : 250 cu.m.\n3. Aggregate Sub-base Course\nQuantity: 1,800 sq.m.\nVolume : 180 cu.m.\n4.Portiand Cement Concrete Pavement (PCCP)\nDimension: (0.20m x 4.0m x 300m)\nQuantity: 1,200 sq.m.\nVolume: 240 cu.m.\n5 Road Shouldering\nQuantity: 600 sq.m.\nVolume : 90 cu.m.\n6. Masonry Line Ditch Canal\nQuantity: 400 L.m.\nVolume : 108 cu.m.\n2\n1\nJOB\nCONTRACT ON LOCAL ACCESS ROAD IN BRGY.\nDUROG - BARACLAYAN ROAD\n1. Clearing and grubbing of site / mobilization of equipment\nQty. : 900 sg.m.\n2. Earthworks\nQuantity: 1.200 sq.m.",
